{"title":"그레이트 써전","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=qFP3Y/hAC1VdKFbg/K1T0LVkKHpwiAiKnTDPso1&filename=th3","synopsis":"최고의 외과 의사가 되기 위한 조건은 무엇일까?\n뛰어난 지식과 정확하고 빠른 기술,\n침착하고도 단호한 판단력과 수많은 경험 등\n어느 하나 소홀히 할 수 없다.\n\n이제 의사로서 첫발을 뗀 김지훈은 최고의 의사라는 꿈을 가슴에 품었다.\n\n\"최고의 의사, 최고의 외과 의사가 될 것이다.\n어떠한 어려움이 있다고 해도 결코 멈추지 않을 것이다.\"\n\n외과 의사라면 누구나 원하지만,\n모든 열정과 힘을 쏟아도 불가능할지 모를\n그레이트 써전(Great surgeon).\n\n꿈을 향해 정진하는 김지훈의 행보를 주목하라!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":212,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":238,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":269,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":163,"change":{"type":"up","amount":106}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":172,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":249,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":238,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":189,"change":{"type":"up","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":253,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-